1
00:00:00,258 --> 00:00:03,198
(Bernadette:)Come on, Howard.
No one's leaving you up there.

2
00:00:03,361 --> 00:00:06,421
(Howard:)I don't know how much
longer I can take this. I can't sleep.

3
00:00:06,598 --> 00:00:09,868
And zero-gravity
is giving me crazy acid reflux.

4
00:00:10,035 --> 00:00:12,975
(Howard:)I'm down to my last three Tums.

5
00:00:14,706 --> 00:00:15,836
You're gonna be fine.

6
00:00:16,007 --> 00:00:18,637
(Bernadette:)You survived that Weight Watchers
cruise with your mom.

7
00:00:20,679 --> 00:00:23,509
(Bernadette:)And they ran out of low-fat ice cream
on day two.

8
00:00:25,684 --> 00:00:28,214
(Bernadette:)Just calm down
and take a few deep breaths.

9
00:00:28,386 --> 00:00:30,516
(Howard:)Okay, okay.

10
00:00:32,924 --> 00:00:36,014
(Howard:)What am I doing?
I'm using up all the oxygen.

11
00:00:39,531 --> 00:00:42,991
(Howard:)If I die, promise you'll never have sex
with another man.

12
00:00:49,407 --> 00:00:51,237
(Amy:)Oh, yeah.

13
00:00:53,445 --> 00:00:57,025
(Amy:)I'm a man-eater now.

